<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Total half-year profits slip.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Total half-year profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year results to end June 1996 for Total Nigeria. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1996	     1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    6,427    vs    8,009</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    697    vs	984</p>
<p>Taxation			193    vs	364</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     504    vs	620</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 0</p>
</text>
